<title>KENYA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 321-8 IN ONE-DAYER WITH PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 321-8 IN ONE-DAYER WITH PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa scored 321 for eight wickets in their 50 overs in their one-day match against Pakistan in the Kenyan Centenary four-nation cricket tournament on Sunday.</p>
</text>
